    "detailed_description": "Add our game to your wishlist, it helps us a lot!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1724807364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1724807364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1724807364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/06750094aacfb4e518ca58df46d95df6.avif?t=1724807364\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME</h2>Help <strong>Dui</strong> find his way home in this challenging puzzle-adventure. Fight bosses, discover new abilities, and learn more about this quirky character on your journey home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/96c0980c6ba6ed3a48c973455613f0d7.avif?t=1724807364\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Platforming<br>Designed around exploring new movement systems to achieve satisfying leaps and bounds across levels.<br><br></li><li>Unlocking Abilities<br>As you progress further in the game, Dui discovers new abilities and mechanics that will help him overcome challenges.<br><br></li><li>Player-Centric Controls<br>Move across levels with a character that has been tediously designed for fluidity and satisfying physics. You hold the reigns.<br><br></li><li>Puzzle Solving<br>Use your skills to overcome platform puzzles.<br><br></li><li>Boss Battles!<br>Go head-to-head in intense boss battles, all while unlocking the mysteries behind the history of Dui.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/bb77a5475894450fa9992808cc06aeaa.avif?t=1724807364\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IS THIS GAME FOR YOU?</h2><br>Dui is a challenging puzzle-adventure, charming platformer, but it's not for everyone. In order to know if Dui is the right game for you, see if you love any of the points down below. (We wont be offended if you don't)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Many Of these Points Do You Like?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Platforming<br></li><li>Unlocking Abilities<br></li><li>A Short But Charming Game<br></li><li>Puzzle Solving<br></li><li>Linear story Telling<br></li><li>Funny Characters</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504440/extras/5462edcf029e374ba04571b3a9f20a93.avif?t=1724807364\" /></span>",
